    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      484.99,
      550.61,
      584.83
    ],
    "text": "Rainy conditions are expected to increase in the southwestern parts of the island from this evening (02 June). Showers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in Galle, Matara, Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts. Fairly heavy falls above 75 mm are likely at some places in these areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      588.73,
      550.46,
      628.27
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in Uva province and in Ampara and Batticaloa districts after 1.00 pm.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Iskoola Pota"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      632.05,
      550.51,
      670.39
    ],
    "text": "Fairly strong winds about (30-40) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the central hills, Northern, North-central, North-western and Southern provinces and in Trincomalee district.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri-Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      673.15,
      550.19,
      713.98
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
